Algorithm 2 Universal Sequence Transformer Module
- 1: Input: Multi-modal features Z = { z h , z g , z t } from encoders 2: Initialize: Modality-specific experts E h , E g , E t , shared multi-head self-attention (MSA) 3: Output: Shared representation F 4: 5: // Modality-Shared Fusion 6: Z ′ ← ModalitySharedMSA ( Z ) + Z 7: // Modality-Specific Decoupling 8: if z h ′ exists then 9: z h ′′ ← E h ( z h ′ ) 10: end if 11: if z g ′ exists then 12: z g ′′ ← E g ( z g ′ ) 13: end if 14: if z t ′ exists then 15: z t ′′ ← E t ( z t ′ ) 16: end if 17: Z ′′ ← concat ( { z h ′′ , z g ′′ , z t ′′ } ) 18: F ← Z ′′ + Z ′ 19: return F
