3.5 Model Deployment
As illustrated in Fig. 1 (c), we append task-specific heads to ALTER for fine-tuning on downstream tasks. Notably, we do not impose any architectural constraints on the task heads. For multimodal tasks, we employ cross-attention to re-embed the CLS tokens, while for other tasks, we use MLPs.
